msgid "Battery Monitoring"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-stellarf4v2.rst:82
#: 1caf9d39f45e46749be20c4ded514c0a
msgid "The board has 1 built-in voltage divider on an ADC input and 1x current ADC input and supports and external 3.3V based current sensor. The voltage input is compatible with 2~8S LiPo batteries."
msgstr ""

